Method Signature:
method MoveNumbersToEnd(s: string) returns (result: string)

Postconditions_prompt:
- The length of the output string is equal to the length of the input string
- All numeric characters in the input string are positioned at the end of the output string
- The non-numeric characters appear in the same order as in the input string and are positioned at the beginning
- The relative order of the non-numeric characters is preserved
- The relative order of the numeric characters is preserved